                                  );
                                },
                              ),
                      ),
                    ),
                    12.horizontalSpace,
                    Expanded(
                      child: Column(
                        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                        children: [
                          ValueListenableBuilder<double>(
                            valueListenable: _progressNotifier,
                            builder: (context, progress, child) {
                              return SliderTheme(
                                data: SliderThemeData(
                                  padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 4.h),
                                  trackHeight: 5.h,
